that's just an illusion.

00:22:33.919 --> 00:22:36.321
Like all there is is just
this kind of, you know,

00:22:36.321 --> 00:22:39.558
endless repetition and, you
know, different variations.

00:22:39.558 --> 00:22:43.228
And I think like one of
the things we saw in 2020

00:22:43.228 --> 00:22:45.964 align:start position:0%
was that it's actually
unsustainable to live that way.

00:22:45.964 --> 00:22:48.600
You actually need
like a final truth

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:52.537 align:start size:97% position:3%
to add a vertical dimension
to your existence.

00:22:52.537 --> 00:22:55.640
And the need for that
