these putzes like Fauci

00:23:19.898 --> 00:23:21.366
to serve in that role?

00:23:21.366 --> 00:23:24.136 align:start position:0%
Why wouldn't you seek, you know,
a deeper and a more ancient

00:23:24.136 --> 00:23:26.071
and a more tried
and trusted version

00:23:26.071 --> 00:23:27.606
of that kind of thought.

00:23:27.606 --> 00:23:29.307 align:start size:97% position:3%
- You know, it's interesting
because one of the things

00:23:29.307 --> 00:23:32.677
that I think helped my
own spiritual awakening,

00:23:32.677 --> 00:23:35.514
obviously not only being on
tour with Jordan Peterson

00:23:35.514 --> 00:23:38.116
