00:23:38.116 --> 00:23:39.351
but you know, during COVID,

00:23:39.351 --> 00:23:41.553
one of the things that
I noticed really quickly

00:23:41.553 --> 00:23:44.089 align:start size:84% position:16%
was that people
who were believers,

00:23:44.089 --> 00:23:46.425
whether they were
Christians or Jews,

00:23:46.425 --> 00:23:48.827
whatever they might be, even
