00:24:25.330 --> 00:24:26.598 align:start size:88% position:13%
they didn't necessarily
have to believe

00:24:26.598 --> 00:24:28.834 align:start size:97% position:3%
in the immediacy of the day.
- Wow.

00:24:28.834 --> 00:24:30.936
- And that kept them
sane throughout that.

00:24:30.936 --> 00:24:32.103
- That's a great observation.

00:24:32.103 --> 00:24:36.575 align:start size:88% position:13%
This is a point on
which the sage Bob Dylan

00:24:36.575 --> 00:24:40.111 align:start size:97% position:3%
