00:25:30.428 --> 00:25:32.831
you get this kind of just,
yeah, like you were saying,

00:25:32.831 --> 00:25:35.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
the day-to-day,
everything kind of turns,

00:25:35.200 --> 00:25:36.268 align:start size:84% position:16%
everything's
different, you know,

00:25:36.268 --> 00:25:38.103
