00:28:13.958 --> 00:28:15.460
what is that? What's
the purpose of that?

00:28:15.460 --> 00:28:17.595
- Right. Well, I mean, I
think this is something

00:28:17.595 --> 00:28:20.265 align:start size:84% position:16%
