00:28:41.453 --> 00:28:42.887
We experience the
world as, you know,

00:28:42.887 --> 00:28:45.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
thing people do have
moral dimensions to them.

00:28:45.890 --> 00:28:49.027
If you steal bread
