00:28:56.134 --> 00:28:57.702 align:start size:84% position:16%
Like, unless you
kind of associate it

00:28:57.702 --> 00:29:00.905
with its consequences and
its spiritual dimension.

00:29:00.905 --> 00:29:03.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, you know, we
think of the culture wars

00:29:03.541 --> 00:29:05.343
as this fight between
like conservatives

00:29:05.343 --> 00:29:08.279
who want morals in art,
and they want to like,

00:29:08.279 --> 00:29:10.715 align:start size:97% position:3%
tell you not to say
