00:37:06.190 --> 00:37:08.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I guess the founders
were really onto something

00:37:08.359 --> 00:37:10.161
with this federalism stuff.

00:37:10.161 --> 00:37:13.264 align:start size:88% position:13%
- I know, those nasty
evil chauvinist whatever

00:37:13.264 --> 00:37:16.200 align:start size:97% position:3%
backwards White
slaveholders. I know, right.

00:37:16.200 --> 00:37:20.137
So I mean, this is Madison's
argument in Federalist 10,

00:37:21.572 --> 00:37:24.075
because it's not a guarantee
by the way that you can do

00:37:24.075 --> 00:37:26.077
