such a big country.

00:37:26.077 --> 00:37:28.179
I mean that's kind of the
problem that the founders

00:37:28.179 --> 00:37:31.882
were up against, and
this was the solution

00:37:31.882 --> 00:37:33.584
that they proposed.

00:37:33.584 --> 00:37:37.855
And I think in our times
