00:37:37.855 --> 00:37:41.459 align:start size:84% position:16%
which is I think
people like you and me

00:37:41.459 --> 00:37:43.894
outnumber people like Joy Reid,

00:37:43.894 --> 00:37:46.530 align:start size:84% position:16%
when you get us away
from the honking,

00:37:46.530 --> 00:37:49.533
screaming idiots on MSNBC.

00:37:49.533 --> 00:37:53.037
I actually think that when
you do what DeSantis is doing

00:37:53.037 --> 00:37:57.041
and you state boldly, like
making no bones about it,

00:37:57.041 --> 00:37:58.909 align:start size:84% position:16%
Americans are
Americans, you know,

00:37:58.909 --> 00:38:03.447
