00:38:07.385 --> 00:38:09.086
What did he find in 2022, right?

00:38:09.086 --> 00:38:12.723 align:start size:84% position:16%
That was like the most
successful approach
to those midterms

00:38:12.723 --> 00:38:15.860 align:start size:88% position:13%
and it was successful
across the races, right?

00:38:15.860 --> 00:38:19.063
It was an interracially
